<title>HONG KONG: Dah Bang mulls acquisitions/fund raising.</title>
<headline>Dah Bang mulls acquisitions/fund raising.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dah Bang (Holdings) Ltd said on Friday it was considering certain asset purchases or conducting a fund raising exercise but the proposals were at a &quot;very preliminary stage&quot; and may not go ahead.</p>
<p>&quot;The nature of assets and the method of the fund raising exercise and their respective size have yet to be determined,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dah Bang shares rose HK$0.15 to close at HK$1.41 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
